[0.484, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[1;97H› \u001b[m\u000fSay READY and nothing else.\u001b[K\u001b[2;97H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b[m\u000fYou have 2 usage limit resets available. Run /usage to use one.\u001b[K\u001b[5;97H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b[m\u000fREADY\u001b[K\u001b[7;97H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\n› \u001b[m\u000f<cross-session-message from=\"uds:/tmp/cc-socks/461.sock\" from-name=\"clau\u001b[10;97Hde-journey\" from-mode=\"prompting\">\u001b[K\u001b[11;97H  List the three largest source files under cxpeer/ with their line counts\u001b[12;97H, one line each.\u001b[K\u001b[13;97H  </cross-session-message>\u001b[K\u001b[14;97H\u001b[K\n  [cxpeer msg_id=7cccde45-5ce6-4b1c-b889-0b9d4de55764] Your final answer t\u001b[16;97Hhis turn is forwarded to claude-journey automatically. To message any sess\u001b[17;97Hion yourself run:\u001b[K\u001b[18;97H  cxpeer send --to <name> \"text\" (cxpeer list shows names).\u001b[K\u001b[19;97H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b[m\u000fI’m using the \u001b[36mcxpeer\u001b[39m skill to answer the requesting session with the rep\u001b[22;97Hository’s three largest source files and line counts.\u001b[K\u001b[23;97H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n•\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[1mExplored\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[25;97H  └ \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36mRead\u001b[39m SKILL.md (cxpeer skill)"]
